 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** $O(k_{max})$, where $k_{max}$ is the number of samples. Typically constant (~5 steps) [S3, S4, unofficial].
+*   **Time Complexity:** $O(k_{max})$, where $k_{max}$ is the number of samples. Typically constant (~5 steps) [S3, unofficial][S4, unofficial].
 *   **Memory Complexity:** $O(1)$, requiring only a few scalar variables [S3, unofficial].
 *   **Performance:** Very fast due to low sample count and no intersection checks [S4, unofficial].
-*   **Strengths:** Simple to implement, low computational cost, suitable for real-time SDF rendering [S3, S4, unofficial].
-*   **Limitations:** Can produce banding effects (rings of different shades) due to finite step sizes [S3, unofficial]. Accuracy depends on SDF quality, particularly at box corners [S3, unofficial].
