 *   **When to use:** Real-time rendering with SDFs where performance is critical and high-quality hemisphere sampling is too expensive [S4, unofficial].
-*   **When not to use:** When high-quality, physically accurate ambient occlusion is required, or when the SDF has significant inaccuracies at corners [S3, unofficial].
