 ## Background
-Quilez Ambient Occlusion is a modification of Evans' approach, using ray marching along the surface normal to estimate ambient occlusion [S3, unofficial]. It was presented by Inigo Quilez [S3, unofficial]. The method is based on the concept of constant step ray marching [S3, S4, unofficial]. It is used in sphere tracing for implicit surfaces to approximate ambient occlusion [S4, unofficial].
